  menuHints:
  - "Check, act, spend, or stop waiting \u2014 the four moves a human has. It has
    one."
  - "Protocol. Radio, escort, hold \u2014 trained verbs. Each one puts time back
    in order."
  - "Tools burn real stock \u2014 flares, film. The cost is the power: you can pay
    one. It can't."
  checkWithForecast: "FORECAST LIVE \u2014 the line under its status is its next
    cheat. Answer with protocol; spend tools when order slips."
  checkWithoutForecast: "It waits. That is all CHECK can read \u2014 you never studied
    the stop. The file is the missing weapon."
  knowledgeLine: {fileID: 2145582374}
  sightState: {fileID: 414957750}
  actionFlavor:
  - "Burn one flare. It ends on its own clock \u2014 paid time is a weapon."
  - One call, three rounds of silence after. A schedule cuts both ways.
  - One frame of film, spent. The flash proves a moment happened.
  - Your whole turn, spent walking her out at human speed.
  - "Costs your time \u2014 the one thing it farms. Spend it knowingly."
  - Costs the case, not you. Stopping your own wait is always legal.
